的仗，\n这点道理我还明白。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[9,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&庞德\n原来曹大人不提马腾主公之死，\n是为了独自承担这个罪名？\n&庞德\n为了成为一个求存于乱世的霸主，\n只好采取这种不拘私怨的上策。\n&庞德\n这种不论善恶都一肩承担的做法，\n原来才是曹操大人真正的为人？\n&庞德\n毫无戒心地接受我庞德，\n也是信任部下的明证吧？\n&庞德\n既然如此，今后我也要好好做，\n为曹丞相尽犬马之劳！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[21,0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n庞德将军……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[21,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n哦？\n大家好像都来了。"]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[15]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,21,0,64,52,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[9,0,1]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[0,54,22,2,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,54,28,2]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[1,54,22,2,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,54,34,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,1,0,54,28,2]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[15,54,22,2,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,54,40,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,1,0,54,34,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,15,0,54,28,2]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[20,54,22,2,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,54,46,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,1,0,54,40,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,15,0,54,34,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,20,0,54,28,2]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[19,54,22,2,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,54,52,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,1,0,54,46,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,15,0,54,40,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,20,0,54,34,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,19,0,54,28,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,0,0,54,80,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,1,0,44,